{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56083","headline":"本命呪 · 杜光庭","name":"本命呪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"本命尊威赫，元辰位豹宫。\n三元分品秩，六十卫躔躬。\n仙吏牌神化，真官亦治功。\n人伦无贵贱，终始赖含洪。\n（《正统道藏》本杜光庭《道门科范大全集》卷四八。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56083.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56083","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}